  [38;5;246m1.[39m [38;5;114m[✔][39m Assigned to you
  [38;5;246mSomeone assigns you a task, or reassigns one away from you. Near-universally the highest-signal event in a team task [39m
  [38;5;246mtool.[39m
  [38;5;246m2.[39m [ ] Comment / mention
  [38;5;246mSomeone comments on a task you're subscribed to, or @-mentions you anywhere. Note: this presumes comments exist, which
[39m  [38;5;246mis itself a feature to build.[39m
[38;5;153m❯[39m [38;5;246m3.[39m [38;5;114m[✔][39m [38;5;153mStatus change[39m
  [38;5;246mA subscribed task moves between states (todo -> in progress -> done). Useful for the creator of a task watching it get
[39m  [38;5;246mfinished.[39m
  [38;5;246m4.[39m [ ] Due date / overdue
  [38;5;246mA subscribed task's due date changes, or it passes its due date. Overdue is time-triggered, not action-triggered - it
[39m  [38;5;246mneeds a scheduled job, unlike everything else here.[39m
